sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant TUI
    participant Runtime
    participant Planner
    participant Executor
    participant Tools
    participant Replanner
    participant Finalizer

    User->>TUI: Tra hồ sơ SV 22520001 và lịch học hôm nay
    TUI->>Runtime: Submit message
    Runtime->>Planner: Build plan from task and tool catalog
    Planner-->>Runtime: Plan with two independent steps

    par Step A: student profile
        Runtime->>Executor: Execute step A
        Executor->>Tools: load_mcp_tool(get_student_profile)
        Tools-->>Executor: Tool loaded
        Executor->>Tools: get_student_profile(student_id)
        Tools-->>Executor: Profile observation
        Executor-->>Runtime: Step A result
    and Step B: today's schedule
        Runtime->>Executor: Execute step B
        Executor->>Tools: load_mcp_tool(get_today_schedule)
        Tools-->>Executor: Tool loaded
        Executor->>Tools: get_today_schedule(student_id)
        Tools-->>Executor: Schedule observation
        Executor-->>Runtime: Step B result
    end

    Runtime->>Replanner: Check plan progress and missing data
    Replanner-->>Runtime: Plan complete
    Runtime->>Finalizer: Synthesize answer from step results
    Finalizer-->>Runtime: Final answer
    Runtime-->>TUI: Stream plan, step results, answer, stats
    TUI-->>User: Show final answer
